	// (#925 item 0.2). It is the ONLY way a moderator can read a room message: the
	// message lives in a capped Valkey stream that item 0.3 exists to let them
	// remove, so a report holding only a pointer becomes unreadable exactly when it
	// is acted on. Carried as a JSON string rather than a nested object so that a
	// malformed row can never produce an invalid API response. Nil for story and
